cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BerryBrain, cite this software artifact and the accompanying article."
title: "BerryBrain: Adaptive Personal Knowledge Management with Semantic Graphs and GraphRAG"
type: software
version: "1.4.8-research-artifact.20260825"
date-released: 2026-08-25
abstract: >-
  BerryBrain is a self-hosted personal knowledge management system that transforms Markdown notes
  into a governed semantic graph, combines lexical, dense, and structural retrieval through
  GraphRAG, and incorporates provenance, confidence estimates, language-model judges, and
  reversible human feedback.
authors:
  - family-names: "Souza"
    given-names: "Mateus Almeida de"
    affiliation: "Federal University of Espirito Santo, CEUNES"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-4701-1282"
repository-code: "https://github.com/imsouza/berrybrain"
url: "https://github.com/imsouza/berrybrain/releases/tag/jbcs-artifact-2026-08-25"
keywords:
  - personal knowledge management
  - personal knowledge graph
  - semantic graph
  - GraphRAG
  - information retrieval
  - human feedback
  - large language model judge
